    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The D!cks are still back and have risen theyre flag... You might need a different perspective to recognize things forreal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thats why you can relife now the best and gamedefining moments from Toey Weedz Smoke One as a sidescrolling Shooter with a 3D twist and again all retro inspired forreal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relife the best and gamedefining moments from Toey Weedz Smoke One in 2D/3D and remixed with new content as a Sidescrolling Shooter forreal!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch the camera to the Firstpersonview to take advantage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >many new handcrafted animations for Toey Weedz and others for the new perspective, bringing a whole new level of retrocharm to the unique handcrafted graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear the Hubworld from all the evil D!ck flags and raise yours, for the weeds </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Coins, buy a health upgrade, or stock up your lifes to prevent a Game Over like in the old days</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat Arnold D!ckler once again, the worst D!cktator ever!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging, Unforgiving, Toey Weedz Forreal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Toey Weedz Forreal&quot; Is challenging, sleek and compact actiongame set in the Toey Weedz Universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Comediac retro inspired Sidescrollingshooter with a 3D Twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become Toey Weedz once again and raise your flag forreal!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The D!cks are still back and have risen theyre flag... You might need a different perspective to recognize things forreal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thats why you can relife now the best and gamedefining moments from Toey Weedz Smoke One as a sidescrolling Shooter with a 3D twist and again all retro inspired forreal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relife the best and gamedefining moments from Toey Weedz Smoke One in 2D/3D and remixed with new content as a Sidescrolling Shooter forreal!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch the camera to the Firstpersonview to take advantage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >many new handcrafted animations for Toey Weedz and others for the new perspective, bringing a whole new level of retrocharm to the unique handcrafted graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear the Hubworld from all the evil D!ck flags and raise yours, for the weeds </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Coins, buy a health upgrade, or stock up your lifes to prevent a Game Over like in the old days</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat Arnold D!ckler once again, the worst D!cktator ever!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging, Unforgiving, Toey Weedz Forreal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Toey Weedz Forreal&quot; Is challenging, sleek and compact actiongame set in the Toey Weedz Universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Comediac retro inspired Sidescrollingshooter with a 3D Twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become Toey Weedz once again and raise your flag forreal!</p>",
